:: Mansion Return Shopping Refuse
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>><<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">><</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident")>>
	"The shops are closed already," you say. "I'm not going."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "special")>>
	"Aren't the shops closed already? I'm not going," you declare.
<<else>>
	"No thank you," you say. "It's a bit too late for it now."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery curls <<his>> lips as if in a smile, but it evaporates at once. "Pity, but you're right. Another time."
<br><br>
<<He>> walks away.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<avery_mansion_end_links>>

:: Mansion Return Shopping Refuse 2
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>><<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">><</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident")>>
	"The shops are closed already," you say. "I'm not going."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Aren't the shops closed already? I'm not going," you say.
<<else>>
	"No thank you," you say. "It's a bit too late for it now."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery breathes out through <<his>> nose. "Then why did you bring up being too shy in the first place? Seems you weren't such a good <<girl>> to begin with..."
<<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<garage>>
<br><br>
<<He>> walks away.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<avery_mansion_end_links>>

:: Mansion Return Shopping Shy
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>><<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">><</if>>
<<if $exposed gte 2>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"L-Like this?" you say. "I can't go out without clothes!"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Naked? I think not," you say.
	<<else>>
		"I can't go out without clothes," you say. "What would the neighbours think?"
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"This attire is inappropriate," you say. "You don't want me to be seen like this, surely!"
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"This attire is inappropriate," you say. "You don't want me to be seen like this, surely!"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"I'm not going out dressed like this," you say. "People will think we're mad."
	<<else>>
		"I'm not dressed for going out," you say. "People will get the wrong idea."
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery frowns a moment, then smiles. "Go change then. I will wait here." <<He>> looks too pleased with the delay.
<br><br>
<<link [[Change (0:05)|Mansion Shopping Change]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Mansion Return Shopping Refuse 2]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Shopping Change
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
You climb the stairs, and walk to the wardrobe in Avery's bedroom.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Wardrobe]]>><<set $phase to 446 >><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Clothing Wardrobe Exit
<<effects>>
You step out of the wardrobe, and examine yourself in the mirror.
<br><br>
<<if $exposed gte 2>>
	<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
		Your nudity excites you, but you can't go outside like this.
	<<else>>
		You couldn't go out in public naked!
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Go shopping (0:30)|Mansion Return Shopping]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Return to wardrobe|Mansion Wardrobe]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Return Shopping
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
<<if $phase is 446>>
You get down the stairs and meet Avery<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>, umbrella in hand<</if>>.
<<else>>
Avery <<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>picks up an umbrella and <</if>>opens the door.
<</if>>
<<if $boutiqueintro is 1>>
	"The same place as the last time. You remember the place, right?"
<<else>>
	"It's a short walk from here," <<he>> says, taking your hand.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Arms linked, Avery leads you through the garden, and outside the mansion grounds.
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	Other pedestrians hurry about, umbrellas aloft.
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
	Other pedestrians trudge through the snow.
<<else>>
	Other pedestrians walk to and fro.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Return Shopping 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Return Shopping 2
<<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
Avery leads you 
<<if $boutiqueintro is 1>>
	in the direction of the boutique. Soon enough, you find yourself in front of the entrance, the place as guarded as always.
<<else>>
	in an opposite direction to the spa. Soon enough, the two of you approach a small boutique on the corner. The door is guarded by two security guards.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You approach the door.
<<if $boutiqueintro is 1>>
	<<if $fame.social gte 1000 + $fame.business gte 1000 gte 1000>>
	The bodyguards nod to you two, clearly recognizing you.
		<<else>>
		The bodyguards look at you cautiously, but Avery's presence calms them down. It's clear they still don't recognize you.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Avery nods at the bodyguards as they open the door. "It has very special pieces inside. The owner takes security very seriously."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Return Shopping 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Mansion Return Shopping 3
<<set $location to "boutique">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<generate2>><<person2>>
<<if $boutiqueintro is 1>>
	As soon as you enter, a <<person>> greets you two. <<if $fame.social gte 1000 + $fame.business gte 1000 lt 1000>>You are surprised <<he>> recognizes you, but Avery must have informed <<him>> in advance. <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<He>> greets you both and proceeds to show the most interesting pieces.
<<else>>
	As soon as you enter, a <<person>> greets Avery. <<He>> is well-dressed, but is clearly working here. A polite smile on <<his>> face.
	"It's wonderful to see you again, <<= C.npc.Avery.pronoun is "m" ? "mister" : "miss">> Avery. And this must be your companion?"
    <br><br>
	After a short introduction, <<he>> leads the two of you to show the most inte~resting pieces.
	<<set $boutiqueintro to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Return Shopping 4]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Mansion Return Shopping 4
<<effects>>
You are encouraged by the <<person>> to try some of the pieces. <<He>> seems to have a good eye, but <<he>> takes Avery's feedback no less important than yours. Soon the choice boils down to only three pieces.
"You look great in these. They suit your eyes. Do you have any favourites?"
<<if $eyeselect is "purple" or $eyeselect is "dark blue" or $eyeselect is "light blue" or $eyeselect is "green" or $eyeselect is "grey" or $eyeselect is "light grey" or $eyeselect is "lime green">>
