:: Mansion Return Shopping 5
<<effects>>
"Good choice. We'll take this one, " Avery points at the rings, and soon you and <<person1>><<him>> are leaving the beautique with a new ring on your finger.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Return Shopping 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: Mansion Return Shopping 6
<<effects>>
You walk back to the mansion with Avery. The gates rattle open.
<br><br>
"I hope you enjoyed it," Avery says, planting a kiss on your hand. "Now to relax."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<pass 2>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
